      "text": "the Lord rules high in heavens, 1 Ne. 17:39. elder brothers claim Nephi1 thinks to rule over them, 2 Ne. 5:3. babes and women shall rule over Judah, 2 Ne. 13:4, 12 (Isa. 3:4, 12). Israel shall rule over oppressors, 2 Ne. 24:2 (Isa. 14:2). if kings were always just men, Nephites should have kings rule over them, Mosiah 29:13. Nephites appoint judges to rule over them, Mosiah 29:41. robbers rule to get gain and glory, Hel. 7:5. men do not desire that the Lord should rule over them, Hel. 12:6.",
